DESCRIPTION:Alison Spittle hosts a night to not remember. Comedians let it 
 all out to Linkin Park\, Korn\, Limp Bizkit\, Crazy Town etc. Is emo nu met
 al? Is Smash Mouth nu metal? What about Metrostation? That's on the edge. N
 o queen! We'll probably end on Black Parade. Do not put your drink near my 
 laptop\, or I will throw hands\, I will not have a repeat of last year. Lon
 g live Monkey Barrell!\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/eve
 nt/nu-metal-karaoke/
